OL,3,AMissing 11-month-old baby found buried
OL,4,Aalive in a crate in South Carolina
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 11-month-old baby has been rescued
OL,7,Fin South Carolina after officials say
OL,8,Fhe was buried alive in a crate by his
OL,9,Ffather.
OL,11,FKoah Sharpe had been missing since
OL,12,FMonday when he was taken by his father,
OL,13,FMichael Comer, 25, according to the
OL,14,FLexington County Sheriff's Department.
OL,15,FComer was arrested on a burglary charge
OL,16,Fon Monday evening but his son was not
OL,17,Fwith him.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
