OL,3,AMissing 11-month-old baby found buried
OL,4,Aalive in a crate in South Carolina
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe baby was found on Tuesday "buried
OL,7,Falive" and "clinging to life" not far
OL,8,Ffrom his father's house, Lexington
OL,9,FCounty Sheriff Jay Koon said at a news
OL,10,Fconference. It is thought he had been
OL,11,Fthere for 24 hours.
OL,13,FThe child is now in hospital receiving
OL,14,Fcare, Koon said, adding he was hopeful
OL,15,Fhe would make a full recovery.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
